1
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:06,400
All of a sudden, so much is happening.
突然間發生了好多事

2
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:09,100
I know. Ross is getting married.
就是啊，羅斯要結婚

3
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,100
Phoebe's making people.
菲比在…做人

4
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:15,210
-Everybody's doing stuff. -We just sit here.
大家都在忙 只有我們坐在這裡

5
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:17,780
If I died, people would know I was here...
要是我死了 大家只會...

7
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:20,610
...only by the ass print on this chair!
從這張椅子的屁股印 知道我存在過

8
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:26,080
-What are we doing? -Wasting our lives.
我們要幹嘛？ 浪費生命

9
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:28,310
I meant for lunch.
我是說午餐吃什麼

10
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:33,160
We have to do something. Something huge!
我們得做一件大事

11
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:36,090
We could climb Mt. Everest.
我們可以去爬珠峰

12
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:39,890
Not something stupid. Something huge!
不是蠢事，是大事

13
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:42,230
I saw an ad for this video.
不，我在錄影帶上看到廣告

14
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:45,130
People climb that thing every day. We could totally do that!
每天都有人在爬 我們也可以爬

15
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:49,170
Why not? I mean,it's just climbing.
誰說不行？只不過是爬山

16
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:52,210
-It's just steep! -Yeah.
只不過很陡

17
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:56,340
We're going! It'd be nice to leave an ass print on Everest.
我們去攻頂 在山頂留屁股印一定很爽

18
00:00:58,620 --> 00:00:59,610
What's up?
在幹什麼？

19
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,620
-We're gonna climb Mt. Everest. -Yeah,baby!
我們要去爬珠峰 沒錯

20
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:04,550
I looked into that.
真的？我也去問過

21
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:09,290
Yeah,but it costs like $60,000, and,you know,you could die.
但是要花6萬，而且可能會死

22
00:01:10,430 --> 00:01:12,230
And you would die.
你們一定會死

23
00:01:16,270 --> 00:01:17,760
We could get that Everest video.
我們可以去借珠峰的錄影帶

24
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:21,570
We could do that without risking our lives at all.
對，那樣就不必冒生命危險

25
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:25,570
While we're at the video store, we could rent Die Hard!
到了錄影帶店 我們還可以借「終極警探」

26
00:01:28,150 --> 00:01:29,510
I just remembered.
我剛想到 

27
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:33,280
That Everest thing is only available through mail order.
那個錄影帶只能郵購

28
00:01:34,290 --> 00:01:36,850
So you'll stay here and hang out with me?
所以你們要留下來陪我羅？ 對

29
00:01:39,690 --> 00:01:41,660
But one of these days...
不過總有一天

30
00:01:41,930 --> 00:01:45,200
...we'll get off our butts and rent Die Hard again!
我們會站起來 再去借一次「終極警探」

32
00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:49,530
The One with the lnvitation
本集播出：「羅斯與瑞秋」

00:01:47,540 --> 00:01:49,530
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

33
00:02:36,850 --> 00:02:41,720
That was fast. It usually takes me hours to get Ben to go down for his nap.
真快，我通常要花2小時 才能讓班乖乖睡覺

34
00:02:41,890 --> 00:02:44,830
He's such a sweetheart. Do you know what he said?
他好可愛 你知道他剛才說什麼？

35
00:02:44,990 --> 00:02:49,190
-Good night,mommy. -That's because he has lots of mommies.
什麼？ 媽咪，晚安 因為他有很多媽咪

37
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:54,300
Yeah,in fact,it's kind of become his word for "woman".
那算是他對女人的通稱

38
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:59,440
So does your uncle Nathan get an invite or not?
怎樣，請不請你的納森叔叔？

39
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,630
Oh,God! Nobody likes him.
沒有人喜歡他

40
00:03:01,910 --> 00:03:05,970
He's so cheap. He'd never fly to London in a million years.
而且他好小器 他絕不會飛去倫敦的

41
00:03:06,180 --> 00:03:07,340
Invite him!
好，請吧

42
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:11,180
Did I do these neat enough?
我寫得還可以嗎？

43
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,350
Yeah,they're fine.
可以 是嗎？

44
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:17,190
We'll say that Ben addressed them.
別人問就說是班寫的

45
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:20,650
You invited Rachel then?
你也請了瑞秋？

46
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:22,490
Sure,why not?
對啊，幹嘛不請？

47
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:24,160
Really?
真的？

48
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:29,140
I wouldn't be comfortable having any of my old lovers there.
我找舊情人去一定會覺得蹩扭

49
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:32,430
Do you think we shouldn't invite her?
你覺得我們不該請她嗎？

50
00:03:32,670 --> 00:03:35,400
You know I absolutely adore Rachel.
不，我很喜歡瑞秋

51
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:39,440
It's just that I thought it might be awkward for you.
我只是怕你會尷尬

53
00:03:39,950 --> 00:03:42,180
But it's absolutely your decision.
不過你決定就好

54
00:03:42,620 --> 00:03:44,020
-More tea? -Sure.
還要茶嗎？ 好

55
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:46,510
Earl Grey?
伯爵（茶）？

56
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:49,750
Fine,invite whoever you want.
好，你想請誰就請誰

57
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:59,990
I don't want to be single,okay? I just want to be married again.
我不想單身，好嗎？我想再婚

58
00:04:04,570 --> 00:04:07,340
And I just want a million dollars!
我想要1百萬

59
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:13,040
Oh God,Monica. Thank God!
瑞秋？ 天哪，摩妮卡，謝天謝地

60
00:04:15,250 --> 00:04:18,550
This is Rachel. Another Lincoln High survivor.
各位，這是瑞秋 她也念林肯高中

61
00:04:18,750 --> 00:04:20,050
This is Chandler.
這是錢德

62
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:21,420
Phoebe.
菲比

63
00:04:21,690 --> 00:04:22,750
Joey.
喬伊

64
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:24,750
-Do you remember Ross? -Sure.
你記得我哥羅斯嗎？ 當然記得

65
00:04:28,900 --> 00:04:30,730
Back in high school...
你或許不知道，念高中時…

66
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:34,400
...I had a major crush on you.
我非常喜歡你

68
00:04:34,740 --> 00:04:35,730
I knew.
我知道 

69
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:37,330
You did?
真的？

70
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:42,180
I figured you thought I was Monica's geeky brother.
我以為你只當我是 摩妮卡的怪胎哥哥

71
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,410
I did.
沒錯

72
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,410
Listen,do you think
你覺得…

73
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:52,120
Try not to let my intense vulnerability become a factor.
請別被我容易緊張的缺點影響

74
00:04:54,290 --> 00:04:57,120
Would it be okay if I asked you out sometime?
我改天可以約你出去嗎？

76
00:05:00,130 --> 00:05:01,430
Maybe.
好啊…或許可以

78
00:05:03,970 --> 00:05:05,900
Okay,maybe I will.
好，或許我會約

79
00:05:08,140 --> 00:05:10,200
See,I see...
我看到...

80
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:12,630
...big passion in your future.
你會有一段火熱戀情

81
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:14,630
-Really? -I do.
真的？ 對

82
00:05:14,940 --> 00:05:18,210
Ross,you're so great.
羅斯，你真好

83
00:05:28,090 --> 00:05:30,110
It's never gonna happen.
別做夢了

84
00:05:31,990 --> 00:05:33,890
I have a question.
我想問個問題

85
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:38,430
Actually,it's not so much a question.
其實不算是問題 

86
00:05:38,630 --> 00:05:41,160
It's more of a general wondering...
比較算是一個疑惑...

87
00:05:41,970 --> 00:05:43,440
...ment.
...慮

88
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:51,140
Well,for a while now, I've been wanting to....
其實我一直想要…

89
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:53,910
Yes,yes.
對

90
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,270
That's right.
沒錯

91
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,680
Look!
你看

92
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:58,610
What?
什麼？

93
00:06:00,490 --> 00:06:02,650
Top of the world looking
…世界的頂端

94
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:04,920
Down on creation
俯瞰萬物

95
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:09,460
And the only explanation I can find
我唯一能找到的解釋

96
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:15,530
Listen,missy! If you want this cart, you'll have to take me with it!
你給我聽著 車在人在，車亡人亡

97
00:06:21,010 --> 00:06:22,870
-Did you see that? -You were incredible!
你看到了嗎？ 你太猛了

98
00:06:23,140 --> 00:06:25,700
A brand-new woman, ladies and gentlemen.
你看到了嗎？ 全新的瑞秋誕生了

99
00:06:25,950 --> 00:06:28,280
I could not have done this without you.
沒有你我絕對辦不到

101
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,890
More clothes in the dryer?
好…還要烘衣服嗎？

102
00:06:41,230 --> 00:06:42,290
I'm fine.
我沒事

103
00:06:42,530 --> 00:06:45,190
You had no right to tell me you had feelings for me.
你沒資格說你對我有感覺

104
00:06:46,470 --> 00:06:49,060
I was doing great with Julie before I found out.
什麼？ 我和茱莉原本過得很好

105
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:53,970
I was doing great too. It's not easy for me to see you with Julie.
我原本過得也很好 你以為看你們在一起很好受嗎

106
00:06:54,210 --> 00:06:56,870
I don't need this right now.
重點是我不想要這樣 好嗎？

107
00:06:57,250 --> 00:06:58,840
It's too late.
來不及了

108
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:02,020
I'm with somebody else. This ship has sailed!
我有別人了，我很快樂 這艘船已經開了

109
00:07:02,220 --> 00:07:04,680
All right,fine! Go ahead and do that.
好，你走啊

110
00:07:04,890 --> 00:07:07,250
I don't need your stupid ship!
我不需要你這艘笨船

111
00:07:07,592 --> 00:07:07,852
好 很好

112
00:07:55,940 --> 00:07:59,400
This is the first time I'm doing something I care about.
我這輩子第一次做我愛做的事

113
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:03,200
I'm doing something that I'm actually good at.
做我真正在行的事

114
00:08:03,440 --> 00:08:04,810
If you don't get that
要是你不懂…

115
00:08:05,110 --> 00:08:09,050
I get that,but I'm tired of your answering machine.
我懂，我很懂，我為你高興 但我不想再跟答錄機交往了

116
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:11,720
I don't know what to do.
我已經沒轍了 

117
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,940
Neither do l!
我也是

118
00:08:13,450 --> 00:08:14,580
Is this about Mark?
跟馬克有關嗎？

119
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:17,380
Oh,my God!
我的天哪 

120
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:19,420
Okay,it's not.
好，不是

121
00:08:20,130 --> 00:08:23,390
I can't keep having this same fight over and over again.
我的天哪 我不能為了同樣的事一吵再吵

122
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:26,260
You're making this too hard!
你快把我逼瘋了 好，我快把你逼瘋了

123
00:08:26,470 --> 00:08:28,630
I am? What do you want me to do?
你要我怎麼做？ 

124
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:32,770
I don't know. Look,maybe we should just take a break.
我不知道… 也許我們應該分開

125
00:08:33,010 --> 00:08:35,940
You're right. Let's cool off.
你說得對，我們先冷靜一下

127
00:08:36,180 --> 00:08:38,810
Let's get some frozen yogurt or something.
去吃點冷凍優格什麼的

129
00:08:41,580 --> 00:08:43,310
A break from us.
不，我是說分手

130
00:08:47,990 --> 00:08:51,820
-Why are we rushing? -The girlfriend I told you about.
我們在趕什麼？ 我昨晚提到的那個女朋友

131
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:55,090
She wants to get back together with me.
她想跟我復合…

132
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:56,250
I found it!
找到了

133
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:58,590
That's so great for you guys!
真是太好了

134
00:08:59,770 --> 00:09:02,790
-Good luck with your girlfriend. -Thank you.
祝你復合成功 謝謝

135
00:09:07,113 --> 00:09:09,513
瑞秋！

136
00:09:11,850 --> 00:09:14,870
-You got my message? -You are right on time.
你聽到留言了嗎？ 你來得正好

137
00:09:15,180 --> 00:09:17,510
Can I be your girlfriend again?
我可以再當你的女朋友嗎？

138
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,210
You can very much.
可以得不得了

139
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,960
I want you to leave. Get out!
你給我走，滾

140
00:09:25,190 --> 00:09:27,020
I want to talk about this.
不，我想留下來談一談

141
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:29,490
All right,how was she?
好，她怎麼樣？

142
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:36,660
-What? -Was she good?
什麼？ 她厲害嗎？

143
00:09:36,870 --> 00:09:37,860
Don't answer!
不要回答

144
00:09:40,210 --> 00:09:43,570
You wanted to talk about it. How was she?
你說你想談，那就談啊 她怎麼樣？

145
00:09:44,910 --> 00:09:45,900
She was....
她…

146
00:09:46,150 --> 00:09:49,740
-She was not good,not good. -Nothing compared to you.
很遜，什麼也比不上你 不好

147
00:09:50,650 --> 00:09:51,640
She was different.
她不一樣

148
00:09:54,890 --> 00:09:56,380
Good different?
好的不一樣？

149
00:09:57,890 --> 00:09:59,720
Nobody likes change.
沒有人喜歡改變

150
00:10:00,860 --> 00:10:02,690
Just stop!
別再說了

151
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,620
The way you owned up to everything.
你這麼坦然認錯 

152
00:10:05,930 --> 00:10:10,200
It's just showed me how much you've grown,you know?
證明你真的成長不少

153
00:10:10,710 --> 00:10:14,570
I mean,my mom never thought this would work out.
我媽一直覺得我們無法復合

154
00:10:15,310 --> 00:10:18,940
She was all, "Once a cheater,always a cheater."
她說：出軌一次就是一輩子

155
00:10:22,950 --> 00:10:26,390
I just wish we hadn't lost those four months.
真希望沒有這4個月的空白

156
00:10:26,650 --> 00:10:31,390
But if time was what you needed just to gain a little perspective. 
但要是時間能讓你看清楚一點

157
00:10:34,060 --> 00:10:37,220
We were on a break!
我們當時分手了！

158
00:10:42,675 --> 00:10:44,802
（瑞秋葛林小姐收）

159
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:49,500
You seem to really like her.
你似乎真的很喜歡她

160
00:10:49,710 --> 00:10:53,440
What do I do? We agreed it'd be a two-week thing.
我能怎麼辦？ 我們說好只在一起2星期

161
00:10:53,710 --> 00:10:55,550
No commitment.
不要有承諾

162
00:10:56,150 --> 00:11:00,780
That girl just spent the entire evening talking to your friends...
那個女孩整晚都跟你的朋友 

163
00:11:01,060 --> 00:11:03,460
...asking to hear stories about you...
嚷著要聽你的事

164
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:06,320
...Iooking through Monica's photo albums.
還有看摩妮卡的相簿

165
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:09,650
You don't do that if you're just in it for two weeks.
只想在一起2周才不會這麼做

166
00:11:10,330 --> 00:11:11,490
You think?
是嗎？

167
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:16,230
You've got 14 hours until she has to be at the airport.
她還有14個小時才要去機場

168
00:11:16,500 --> 00:11:18,800
And you're sitting here in a hallway...
你卻坐在走廊上 

169
00:11:19,010 --> 00:11:22,240
...with a 28-year-old cheerleader with a fat lip.
陪一個嘴腫起來的老啦啦隊長

170
00:11:25,850 --> 00:11:28,080
-You're right. -Yeah.
你說得對

171
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,650
This is so amazing!
真好

172
00:11:43,330 --> 00:11:46,130
My brother's getting married and in London!
我哥哥居然要去倫敦結婚 

173
00:11:46,330 --> 00:11:48,360
It's so romantic.
好浪漫喔

174
00:11:49,700 --> 00:11:51,700
Hey,pretty smart!
真聰明

175
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:52,930
Tissue paper.
附面紙

176
00:11:53,210 --> 00:11:55,680
You're at the wedding. You have to cry.
參加婚禮當然會哭

177
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:58,280
Handkerchief? No,I got my invitation.
需要手帕嗎？不了，我有喜帖

178
00:12:00,750 --> 00:12:02,240
Isn't this adorable?
真可愛

179
00:12:02,450 --> 00:12:05,040
Ross let Ben address mine.
羅斯讓班寫我的信封

180
00:12:08,260 --> 00:12:11,120
Did you get your invitation to Ross' wedding?
你收到羅斯的喜帖了嗎？ 

181
00:12:11,730 --> 00:12:13,280
No.
沒有

182
00:12:14,030 --> 00:12:17,360
Don't worry,I get to bring a guest. We'll show him.
放心，我可以帶一位親友 看他怎麼說

183
00:12:17,900 --> 00:12:19,530
I'm so jealous you're all going.
好嫉妒你們都要去 

184
00:12:19,730 --> 00:12:22,900
I never knew you can't fly in your third trimester.
懷孕9個月居然不能坐飛機

185
00:12:23,070 --> 00:12:24,200
I didn't,either.
我也不知道

186
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:26,070
I knew that.
我知道

187
00:12:26,870 --> 00:12:30,240
So I didn't know that. But you should see your faces.
我不知道，但你們的表情好妙

188
00:12:31,410 --> 00:12:32,400
What's up?
你們在幹嘛？

189
00:12:33,380 --> 00:12:35,080
Just hanging out.
也沒幹嘛

190
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:43,420
What's this? Ross' wedding invitation?
這是什麼？羅斯的喜帖？

191
00:12:44,130 --> 00:12:47,120
Maybe that's the one we should have hidden.
也許該藏的是那一張

192
00:12:47,860 --> 00:12:51,030
No,you guys,come on. You don't have to do that.
不，不必那樣 

193
00:12:51,230 --> 00:12:53,030
I'm happy for him.
我很替他高興

194
00:12:53,270 --> 00:12:55,930
I am. I really
真的，我很…

195
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:57,570
I'll work on it.
我會調適的

196
00:12:58,770 --> 00:12:59,760
I'm sorry.
對不起

197
00:13:02,340 --> 00:13:04,940
You're going to come,though, aren't you?
不過你會去吧？

198
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:06,770
I don't know.
我不知道

199
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:10,620
This isn't one of those "lf she doesn't come,we don't come"?
該不會她不去我們就不去吧？ 

200
00:13:10,850 --> 00:13:13,380
-I bought my ticket. -You're not even invited.
我已經買票了 他根本沒請你

201
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:19,480
You know what would be real weird? If you weren't there.
你不去會很奇怪

202
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:23,920
-Just say you'll think about it. -I'll think about it.
你就考慮一下吧 我會的

203
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:29,590
-Who's this from? -That's Ross'.
這是誰送的？ 羅斯送的

204
00:13:35,780 --> 00:13:37,440
Oh,my God!
天哪

205
00:13:38,610 --> 00:13:39,840
He remembered.
他記得 

206
00:13:40,250 --> 00:13:41,270
Remembered what?
記得什麼？

207
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:45,410
It was months ago. We were walking by this antique store.
好幾個月前 我們經過一家古董店

208
00:13:45,650 --> 00:13:49,180
I saw this and told him it was like one my grandmother had...
我看到這個別針對他說 

209
00:13:49,420 --> 00:13:51,760
...when I was a little girl.
小時我奶奶有一個一模一樣的

210
00:13:52,030 --> 00:13:54,150
I can't believe he remembered!
他居然記得

211
00:13:54,330 --> 00:13:55,890
This must've cost a fortune.
他一定花了很多錢 

212
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:57,290
I can't believe he did this.
他居然這麼大方

213
00:13:57,500 --> 00:14:00,160
Remember when he fell in love with Carol...
羅斯耶，他大學愛上卡蘿時 

214
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:03,460
...and got her that expensive crystal duck?
就送了她一隻超貴的水晶鴨

215
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:05,800
What did you just say?
你剛才說什麼？

216
00:14:17,420 --> 00:14:19,980
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

217
00:14:20,520 --> 00:14:23,420
Flight number 457 from Beijing now arriving.
來自北京的457號班機 剛剛抵達

218
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:28,650
Oh,my God!
天哪

219
00:14:28,860 --> 00:14:31,700
-We were in school together. -We haven't seen each other since.
我們是老同學 畢業後就沒見過

220
00:14:31,930 --> 00:14:35,700
I land in China. Guess who's in charge of the dig?
到了中國 你們猜是誰主持挖掘工作？

221
00:14:35,970 --> 00:14:37,030
Julie!
茱莉

222
00:14:38,670 --> 00:14:40,140
Isn't that great?
很棒吧？

223
00:14:40,670 --> 00:14:44,970
Isn't that just kick-you-in-the-crotch, spit-on-your-neck fantastic?
真是老二被踹到腰去閃到的爽

224
00:14:48,020 --> 00:14:50,420
That is so sweet!
你真好

226
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,920
No,you hang up.
不…不，你先掛

227
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:57,710
No,you
不，你…

228
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:02,160
One,two,three.
好 一，二，三

229
00:15:04,370 --> 00:15:05,590
You didn't hang up!
你也沒掛 

230
00:15:05,830 --> 00:15:07,730
She didn't hang up either.
她也沒掛

231
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:14,400
Okay,no. No,you hang up.
不，你掛 你掛

232
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:16,910
You!
你掛…

233
00:15:21,450 --> 00:15:23,110
Ross,hi.
羅斯，嗨

234
00:15:23,450 --> 00:15:24,580
It's Rachel.
我是瑞秋

235
00:15:25,450 --> 00:15:29,390
I'm just calling to say that everything's fine.
我只是打來告訴你一切都很好

236
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,860
And I'm really happy for you...
我很替你...

237
00:15:32,260 --> 00:15:34,190
...and your cat.
...和你的貓高興

238
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:39,890
Obviously,I am over you.
所以顯然的，我已經放下你了

239
00:15:40,130 --> 00:15:43,230
I am over you.
我已經放下你了

240
00:15:43,470 --> 00:15:48,460
And that,my friend, is what they call closure.
而那樣，就是所謂的了結

241
00:15:51,310 --> 00:15:53,040
I got a message from you.
瑞秋，有你的留言

242
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:55,750
Oh,my God! Hang up the phone!
完了，羅斯，掛掉 

243
00:15:56,050 --> 00:15:57,980
Give me the phone!
電話給我…

244
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:07,830
You're over me?
你放下我了？ 

245
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:09,460
Oh,God.
天哪

247
00:16:12,430 --> 00:16:13,560
You're over me?
你放下我了？

248
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,430
When were you...
你什麼時候…

249
00:16:18,670 --> 00:16:20,330
...under me?
舉起我的？

250
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,740
Basically...
基本上…

251
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:26,970
...Iately,I've....
最近…我…

252
00:16:28,850 --> 00:16:31,580
I've sort of had feelings for you.
我有點對你有感覺

253
00:16:32,590 --> 00:16:33,750
I need to lie down.
好，我得躺下

254
00:16:35,660 --> 00:16:37,620
He broke up with Julie!
他跟茱莉分手了

255
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:41,360
Go hug her,for God's sakes!
過去抱她啊

256
00:16:43,130 --> 00:16:45,160
-Really? -Really.
真的？ 真的

257
00:16:46,430 --> 00:16:48,700
It's always been you,Rach.
我一直都只要你 

258
00:16:48,970 --> 00:16:50,200
Oh,God.
天哪

259
00:16:58,750 --> 00:17:01,110
Listen,I'm sorry I had to work tonight.
抱歉今晚還得工作

260
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:03,450
That's okay.
沒關係

261
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:05,520
You're worth the wait.
你值得我等

262
00:17:06,650 --> 00:17:08,850
And I don't just mean tonight.
我不只是指今晚

263
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,050
Oh,God!
天哪

264
00:17:38,350 --> 00:17:39,510
Honey.
親愛的

265
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:41,350
That's okay.
沒關係

266
00:17:42,390 --> 00:17:44,880
No,you just rolled over the juice box.
不是，你壓到果汁了

267
00:17:48,800 --> 00:17:53,630
Did you say anything to Rachel about me and the girl from the copy place?
阿甘，你沒告訴瑞秋 我跟影印店女生的事吧？

268
00:17:54,230 --> 00:17:55,570
I'm sorry.
對不起

269
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,740
Was I not supposed to?
我不該說嗎？

270
00:18:04,650 --> 00:18:06,240
You ended it!
是你要分手的

271
00:18:06,410 --> 00:18:10,410
Because I was mad at you. Not because I stopped loving you.
因為我很氣你 不是因為我不愛你了

272
00:18:11,590 --> 00:18:12,780
You still love me?
你還愛我？ 沒有

273
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:20,530
What does this mean? Do you want to get back together?
什麼意思？你想復合嗎？

274
00:18:21,530 --> 00:18:22,760
Maybe.
不是…也許吧

275
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:25,690
I don't know.
我不知道

276
00:18:26,770 --> 00:18:28,960
I just,I feel....
我只是覺得…

277
00:18:37,910 --> 00:18:42,470
I can't believe I even thought of getting back together. We're so over!
我居然會想跟你復合 我們根本就完了

278
00:18:44,450 --> 00:18:46,150
Fine by me!
無所謂

279
00:18:47,390 --> 00:18:50,910
And hey! Just so you know, it's not that common.
順便告訴你 這種事並不常見

280
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:54,790
It doesn't happen to every guy, and it is a big deal.
並非男人都會這樣 這是很嚴重的

281
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:57,590
I knew it!
我就知道

282
00:19:08,210 --> 00:19:11,370
Rachel's coming up. Doesn't she look pretty?
瑞秋來了，她是不是很美啊？

283
00:19:13,610 --> 00:19:14,980
Oh,my God!
天哪 

284
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:17,210
This is us getting ready for the prom.
這是我們準備要去參加舞會

285
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:20,110
We don't have to watch this.
這種帶子就別看了

286
00:19:20,290 --> 00:19:21,280
Yeah,we do!
當然要看 

287
00:19:21,560 --> 00:19:22,610
Come on!
拜託啦

288
00:19:23,190 --> 00:19:26,350
-Get a shot of Monica. -How do you zoom out?
拍一下摩妮卡 怎麼拉遠？

289
00:19:26,630 --> 00:19:28,390
There she is!
有了

290
00:19:30,130 --> 00:19:33,030
Shut up! The camera adds 10 pounds.
閉嘴，上鏡頭會多10磅

291
00:19:33,230 --> 00:19:35,830
So how many cameras are actually on you?
所以是有幾個鏡頭對著你？

292
00:19:37,070 --> 00:19:38,870
Dad,turn it off!
爸，關掉啦

293
00:19:39,140 --> 00:19:40,370
It is off.
我關了

294
00:19:40,570 --> 00:19:42,060
Right,Ross?
對吧，羅斯？

295
00:19:46,750 --> 00:19:48,910
Looking good,Mr. Kotter!
粉帥喔，麥克風頭

296
00:19:51,220 --> 00:19:55,210
I can't go to my prom without a date. It's too late.
我沒舞伴不能去舞會 時間來不及了

297
00:19:55,490 --> 00:19:58,720
If you're not going, then I don't want to go either.
要是你不去，我也不想去了

298
00:19:58,990 --> 00:20:00,960
I have a wonderful idea.
我有個好主意 

299
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:03,390
You should take Rachel to the prom.
你帶瑞秋去參加舞會

300
00:20:03,630 --> 00:20:05,360
We've seen enough. Let's turn it off.
看夠了，關掉吧 

301
00:20:05,630 --> 00:20:08,660
-I want to see! -Fine,I'm not going to watch.
我想看嘛！ 那我不看，行吧？

302
00:20:08,900 --> 00:20:10,030
Come on,kid. Let's go.
走吧

303
00:20:11,140 --> 00:20:12,900
Are you handsome!
你好帥 

304
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:14,700
Let's show them!
去讓他們瞧瞧

305
00:20:18,910 --> 00:20:21,380
-Okay,Dad. -Rachel,ready or not.
行了 瑞秋，不管你好了沒

306
00:20:21,650 --> 00:20:24,080
Here comes your knight in shining
解救你的白馬王…糟了

307
00:20:25,624 --> 00:20:29,424
再見 奇普，快點

308
00:20:31,260 --> 00:20:32,820
Oh,dear!
天哪…

309
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:34,750
How do I turn this off?
要怎麼關掉？

310
00:20:37,100 --> 00:20:39,160
I can't believe you did that.
你居然真的這樣做了

311
00:20:39,900 --> 00:20:41,770
Yeah,well....
我就…

312
00:20:59,250 --> 00:21:01,590
See? He's her lobster!
看吧，他是她的龍蝦

313
00:21:10,930 --> 00:21:12,960
No.
不會吧…

314
00:21:13,470 --> 00:21:15,400
You're really not going?
你真的不去？

315
00:21:16,540 --> 00:21:18,870
It's just going to be too hard.
對，我會很難面對

316
00:21:19,410 --> 00:21:21,470
You know,I mean...
畢竟…

317
00:21:21,740 --> 00:21:23,540
...it's Ross.
他是羅斯

318
00:21:24,240 --> 00:21:26,800
How can I watch him get married?
我怎麼能看著他結婚？

319
00:21:28,220 --> 00:21:31,410
It's just for the best. You know? It is.
這樣最好，真的

320
00:21:31,690 --> 00:21:34,350
Plus somebody's got to stay here with Phoebe.
而且總得有人陪菲比 

321
00:21:34,590 --> 00:21:37,350
She's going to be pretty big by then.
到時她的肚子會很大

322
00:21:37,590 --> 00:21:40,150
She'll need someone to help her tie her shoes.
她會需要別人綁鞋帶

323
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:43,990
Drive her to the hospital if she goes into labor.
在她要生的時候送她去醫院

324
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:46,560
You don't have a car.
你沒有車

325
00:21:46,770 --> 00:21:48,700
And your license expired.
駕照也過期了

326
00:21:50,500 --> 00:21:53,700
There's so much to do, and I have so little time!
看吧，事情那麼多 時間卻那麼少

327
00:21:58,950 --> 00:22:00,340
Check this out.
你們看 

328
00:22:00,550 --> 00:22:04,010
There's a place you can go to rent videos of all the museums.
這裡有完整的博物館錄影帶

329
00:22:04,220 --> 00:22:07,050
"It's almost as good as being there."
「幾乎如同身歷其境」

330
00:22:07,390 --> 00:22:10,980
It's better! You can't go to a museum in your underwear.
更棒，去博物館不能穿內褲

331
00:22:12,090 --> 00:22:14,390
You could,but just the one time.
可以，但之後你會被封殺

332
00:22:16,500 --> 00:22:18,660
We could get videos of the sights...
我們可以去租景點錄影帶

333
00:22:18,870 --> 00:22:22,430
...get a VCR in our hotel room and never have to go outside!
搬台錄放影機就不必出房間了

334
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:25,530
-lf we do that,we've got to rent Die Hard. -I bet the British version is good!
那一定要租「終極警探」

335
00:22:27,579 --> 00:22:29,975
英國版一定很贊

